<title>DUBAI: Oman's Sultan Qaboos arrives in Abu Dhabi.</title>
<headline>Oman's Sultan Qaboos arrives in Abu Dhabi.</headline>
<dateline>DUBAI 1996-12-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Oman's Sultan Qaboos bin Said arrived in the United Arab Emirates (UAE) capital Abu Dhabi on Monday for talks with President Sheikh Zaid bin Sultan al-Nahayan, the the official UAE News Agency (WAM) said.</p>
<p>He flew in from Doha where he attended the annual Gulf Cooperation Council summit that ended earlier on Monday.</p>
<p>Sheikh Zaid, who is recovering from neck surgery, stayed away from the summit. Vice-President Sheikh Maktoum bin Rashid al-Maktoum represented the UAE at the summit.</p>
</text>
